#: ../../source/developer-guide/documentation.md:125
msgid "Adding a page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/documentation.md:127
msgid "Create the `.md` file in the appropriate section directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/documentation.md:128
msgid "Add it to the `toctree` in that section's `index.md`."
